WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:46.653 --> 00:01:48.989
This is awful!

00:01:48.989 --> 00:01:52.659
Awful! Awful! Awful!
This is awful, Mr. Masaki!

00:01:52.659 --> 00:01:55.028
It's too salty, Father.

00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:59.199
Gross! It's got eggplant in it, Mr. Masaki!

00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:03.236
It can't be helped, okay? Sasami's in bed sick.

00:02:03.236 --> 00:02:06.706
He went to all the trouble of
making this, so don't complain.

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:10.733
I'd give this a -10, Mr. Masaki.

00:02:11.511 --> 00:02:15.315
- Make it stronger, Mr. Masaki!
- Could you make it weaker, Mr. Masaki?

00:02:15.315 --> 00:02:18.552
What're you saying? It's not real <i>miso</i> soup

00:02:18.552 --> 00:02:21.054
unless it's strong
enough to pucker your face!

00:02:21.054 --> 00:02:25.192
This is why you're an unrefined,
barbaric, bestial, all-round yokel!

00:02:25.192 --> 00:02:27.093
Say what?

00:02:27.093 --> 00:02:30.263
You're complaining to Ryoko,
the gold-medal winner

00:02:30.263 --> 00:02:34.597
of the Universal Pirate Gourmet contest?

00:02:35.335 --> 00:02:39.139
All you're used to is the
Galaxy Police's prison food.

00:02:39.139 --> 00:02:41.675
You're in no position to criticize me,

00:02:41.675 --> 00:02:45.236
the three-star gourmand
of the Jurai royal house!

00:02:47.347 --> 00:02:48.515
- What do you think you're doing?!
- What do you think you're doing?!

00:02:48.515 --> 00:02:49.416
- It's too strong!
- Too weak!

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:55.822
- Strong! Strong! Strong! Strong!
- Weak! Weak! Weak! Weak!

00:02:55.822 --> 00:02:58.592
- Hey, cut it...
- I'm telling you it's too strong!

00:02:58.592 --> 00:03:01.356
- I'm telling you it's too weak!
- Eggplant!

00:03:02.462 --> 00:03:03.451
Ow.

00:03:12.639 --> 00:03:15.675
C-Cleaning and laundry...

00:03:15.675 --> 00:03:17.944
Make dinner...

00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:21.744
Cleaning and laundry... Make dinner...

00:03:23.617 --> 00:03:24.818
Too strong...

00:03:24.818 --> 00:03:26.052
Too weak...

00:03:26.052 --> 00:03:28.043
Eggplant...

00:03:54.114 --> 00:03:55.547
That scared me...

00:04:03.323 --> 00:04:06.486
It must be nice to be as free as a cloud...

00:04:08.795 --> 00:04:13.528
I'm beat, Dear.

00:04:17.804 --> 00:04:20.466
I wonder if Tenchi's doing okay?

00:04:23.777 --> 00:04:25.642
Tokyo...

00:04:36.656 --> 00:04:41.394
You already have someone
waiting for you, don't you, Masaki?

00:04:41.394 --> 00:04:44.886
I knew you'd be a bad liar.

00:05:01.181 --> 00:05:03.411
Where the heck is Tenchi?

00:05:09.823 --> 00:05:10.924
Matori.

00:05:10.924 --> 00:05:14.223
I know. That's the man, right?

00:05:20.066 --> 00:05:21.829
Okay, then...

00:05:29.476 --> 00:05:30.644
Ow...

00:05:30.644 --> 00:05:32.445
Are you all right?

00:05:32.445 --> 00:05:34.848
Yes, thank you...

00:05:34.848 --> 00:05:37.043
Masaki's father!

00:05:38.184 --> 00:05:41.087
You're Tenchi's friend, um...

00:05:41.087 --> 00:05:44.724
It's... It's nice to see you again.

00:05:44.724 --> 00:05:46.259
Tenchi's friend, uh...

00:05:46.259 --> 00:05:47.427
Huh?

00:05:47.427 --> 00:05:50.362
His friend, um...

00:05:51.398 --> 00:05:53.229
Um...

00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:57.103
Uh...

00:05:57.103 --> 00:06:03.677
Right, Tenchi's friend! What a
coincidence, running into you here!

00:06:03.677 --> 00:06:05.512
Do you live around here?

00:06:05.512 --> 00:06:08.581
Huh? Uh... That's right.

00:06:08.581 --> 00:06:10.583
Well, standing here and chatting is nice,

00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:14.041
but would you mind
showing me to Tenchi's place?

00:06:15.522 --> 00:06:16.856
Sure.

00:06:16.856 --> 00:06:20.860
Now I remember! Sakuya Shirokuma!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.995
Uh...

00:06:21.995 --> 00:06:22.862
Yes?

00:06:22.862 --> 00:06:25.732
It's "Kumashiro."

00:06:25.732 --> 00:06:27.256
Oh. Had it backwards.

00:06:31.271 --> 00:06:32.670
Coming!

00:06:33.773 --> 00:06:36.309
Dad? What are you doing here?

00:06:36.309 --> 00:06:40.046
It's nothing important. I had
some business to take care of here.

00:06:40.046 --> 00:06:42.816
I just thought I'd drop by.

00:06:42.816 --> 00:06:44.451
It's kinda sudden...

00:06:44.451 --> 00:06:46.146
Oh, and more importantly...

00:06:47.053 --> 00:06:48.884
K-Kumashiro!

00:06:52.358 --> 00:06:53.760
I'm starving...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.496
Where in the world did Father go?

00:06:56.496 --> 00:06:59.032
Kiyone, wake up...

00:06:59.032 --> 00:07:01.167
Ayeka, make something...

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:03.503
Ryoko, cook dinner...

00:07:03.503 --> 00:07:05.038
You make it!

00:07:05.038 --> 00:07:06.372
Why should I?

00:07:06.372 --> 00:07:07.774
I said to make it, so make it!

00:07:07.774 --> 00:07:09.435
Silence, you big ape!

00:07:14.013 --> 00:07:17.574
Hey, I know! Let's go out to eat!

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:29.763
This seems awkward for some reason...

00:07:29.763 --> 00:07:33.266
Is it because I'm here?

00:07:33.266 --> 00:07:35.769
Oh, I get it! These two are...

00:07:35.769 --> 00:07:40.106
What am I thinking? I have to
show some adult generosity here...

00:07:40.106 --> 00:07:44.177
I have to help out these two kids.

00:07:44.177 --> 00:07:49.549
Right. First, I need to break
the ice here, but nonchalantly.

00:07:49.549 --> 00:07:51.718
- I...
- Um...

00:07:51.718 --> 00:07:55.755
High school baseball is
really exciting this year, huh?

00:07:55.755 --> 00:07:59.626
It seems to me that
Kibidango High is on a roll!

00:07:59.626 --> 00:08:01.461
I'm looking forward to a
showdown between them

00:08:01.461 --> 00:08:03.861
and the veterans at Onigashima High!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:11.104
Damn! Talking about the local
Okayama Prefecture playoffs was a bad move!

00:08:11.104 --> 00:08:14.040
This is like a conversation
some local geezers would have!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:18.841
I've gotta steer it towards something
younger and more urban... More "now."

00:08:21.581 --> 00:08:25.347
Speaking of waiting, you know
what they say about Hachiko-mae...

00:08:29.189 --> 00:08:32.125
Stupid, stupid, stupid!
Hachiko-mae? What was I thinking?!

00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:36.029
Okay, then! This will show
off my wit and sense of humor!

00:08:36.029 --> 00:08:40.125
Say, I hear they put up a
fence around the wall next door.

00:08:51.311 --> 00:08:55.213
Excuse me. I'll go buy
some cold drinks or something.

00:09:03.289 --> 00:09:07.089
I like that old man! I can use him!

00:09:10.864 --> 00:09:16.603
We're not stealing anything,
we're just gonna go out to eat. Okay?

00:09:16.603 --> 00:09:19.405
Trust us! Okay?

00:09:19.405 --> 00:09:21.896
Please!

00:09:24.043 --> 00:09:28.639
Why, you little... We act polite,
and you get all high and mighty!

00:09:30.116 --> 00:09:31.947
Have it your way, then!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:47.934
M-My, how strong you've become, Ryo-Ohki...

00:09:47.934 --> 00:09:50.562
P-Pardon us!

00:09:51.971 --> 00:09:55.930
Cooking and laundry... Cleaning...

00:10:02.815 --> 00:10:05.579
So I don't belong here, either?

00:10:06.386 --> 00:10:07.876
Dear...

00:10:17.263 --> 00:10:19.891
You'll be playing the part of Cupid today.

00:10:25.838 --> 00:10:28.908
I think you'll make the son fall in love,

00:10:28.908 --> 00:10:31.711
you guardian spirit born
of his latent consciousness...

00:10:31.711 --> 00:10:32.979
My PretenDad!

00:10:32.979 --> 00:10:33.813
Love...

00:10:33.813 --> 00:10:40.153
Listen. Your orders are to play Cupid
and bind those two together in love!

00:10:40.153 --> 00:10:41.620
Love, love.

00:10:42.689 --> 00:10:45.024
I'll leave the details up to you, but...

00:10:45.024 --> 00:10:48.628
Love! Love! Love!

00:10:48.628 --> 00:10:50.196
Hey, come back here! Hey!

00:10:50.196 --> 00:10:51.925
Love!

00:11:08.781 --> 00:11:12.418
I... I've gotta say something.

00:11:12.418 --> 00:11:14.487
Um...

00:11:14.487 --> 00:11:18.391
I'm sorry. Your dad came all
the way here to see you, and I...

00:11:18.391 --> 00:11:22.061
No, I'm sorry. My dad was the one
who made you go to all this trouble.

00:11:22.061 --> 00:11:25.398
It's okay. Your dad's really interesting!

00:11:25.398 --> 00:11:27.127
I suppose...

00:11:29.335 --> 00:11:31.771
Dad sure is taking a long time.

00:11:31.771 --> 00:11:34.638
Just a minute, I'll go make some coffee.

00:11:47.687 --> 00:11:49.789
I'm sorry. I just remembered
something I need to do.

00:11:49.789 --> 00:11:51.188
Huh?

00:12:04.937 --> 00:12:07.907
Love! Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:12:07.907 --> 00:12:11.673
- Huh? Masaki's father?
- Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:12:17.116 --> 00:12:18.845
I love you.

00:12:21.354 --> 00:12:26.726
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:12:26.726 --> 00:12:29.996
That's what his subconscious wanted?

00:12:29.996 --> 00:12:31.930
That stupid old man!

00:12:32.965 --> 00:12:35.134
Food...

00:12:35.134 --> 00:12:37.270
Dinner...

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:41.434
Eggpla... Uh, I mean Kiyone...

00:12:43.776 --> 00:12:48.475
Love! Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:12:51.084 --> 00:12:53.575
What a babe!

00:12:55.054 --> 00:12:56.214
Love!

00:12:57.423 --> 00:12:58.791
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:12:58.791 --> 00:13:00.190
Gross!

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.559
Even so, I love you.

00:13:09.602 --> 00:13:10.803
Love!

00:13:10.803 --> 00:13:13.465
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:13:18.111 --> 00:13:19.703
I love you.

00:13:21.614 --> 00:13:22.949
What a weird old man...

00:13:22.949 --> 00:13:24.350
Idiot...

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:29.014
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:13:30.756 --> 00:13:32.225
I love you.

00:13:32.225 --> 00:13:33.658
Gross...

00:13:36.262 --> 00:13:38.730
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:13:43.669 --> 00:13:45.364
I'm back!

00:13:51.577 --> 00:13:55.775
"I went to look for Kumashiro.
Have some tea while you're waiting."

00:13:57.517 --> 00:14:00.111
Our boy's growing up, Dear...

00:14:00.419 --> 00:14:03.089
What're you doing, you big idiot?!

00:14:03.089 --> 00:14:06.859
Who told you to grab
people off the street?! Who?!

00:14:06.859 --> 00:14:09.692
I didn't think you'd be that kind of jerk!

00:14:11.497 --> 00:14:18.571
Your orders are to
bring those two together!

00:14:18.571 --> 00:14:20.506
Love...

00:14:20.506 --> 00:14:23.042
Bring 'em together!

00:14:23.042 --> 00:14:24.177
Love!

00:14:24.177 --> 00:14:28.981
Listen up, PretenDad! If you
screw up again, you're history!

00:14:28.981 --> 00:14:30.183
Love.

00:14:30.183 --> 00:14:32.251
Then get going!

00:14:32.251 --> 00:14:33.653
Love...

00:14:33.653 --> 00:14:35.314
I love you.

00:14:36.522 --> 00:14:37.390
You pinhead!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.554
Love!

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.096
I don't know what I should say.

00:14:48.201 --> 00:14:49.668
But...

00:14:52.638 --> 00:14:56.096
But I'd be a complete jerk
if I don't say something.

00:15:03.816 --> 00:15:06.018
I'm a coward, too...

00:15:06.018 --> 00:15:12.116
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:15:23.603 --> 00:15:26.731
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:15:29.208 --> 00:15:33.512
- Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:15:33.512 --> 00:15:35.214
- Dad?
- Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:15:35.214 --> 00:15:39.241
- Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:15:40.219 --> 00:15:42.255
I love you.

00:15:42.255 --> 00:15:44.156
Kumashiro!

00:15:44.156 --> 00:15:45.691
Dad?

00:15:45.691 --> 00:15:48.394
No, it's a guardian spirit!

00:15:48.394 --> 00:15:49.929
Let go of Kumashiro!

00:15:49.929 --> 00:15:51.760
Love. Love.

00:15:55.401 --> 00:15:57.164
Why, you...

00:15:57.703 --> 00:15:59.572
Love!

00:15:59.572 --> 00:16:01.597
Come back here!

00:16:02.475 --> 00:16:05.311
I'm not expecting much from you.

00:16:05.311 --> 00:16:09.181
Just run around and
keep the boy after you.

00:16:09.181 --> 00:16:13.379
And then for the grand
finale, the real father will...

00:16:20.526 --> 00:16:21.993
That's a bad sign...

00:16:26.532 --> 00:16:30.161
No, it couldn't be...
Something's happened to Tenchi?!

00:16:30.536 --> 00:16:31.628
Oops.

00:16:39.679 --> 00:16:40.880
Let go of her.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.370
Love!

00:16:44.784 --> 00:16:46.552
Masaki?

00:16:46.552 --> 00:16:48.454
Let go of Kumashiro!

00:16:48.454 --> 00:16:50.856
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:16:50.856 --> 00:16:53.222
Love!

00:16:53.826 --> 00:16:55.127
Masaki!

00:16:55.127 --> 00:16:57.296
T-Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:16:57.296 --> 00:16:58.991
Tenchi!

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:02.998
Masaki!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.671
Tenchi!

00:17:05.671 --> 00:17:07.206
Tenchi, he's...

00:17:07.206 --> 00:17:12.611
And his girlfriend Shirokuma's
been captured by an ugly monster!

00:17:12.611 --> 00:17:13.646
Dad!

00:17:13.646 --> 00:17:15.548
It's "Kumashiro!"

00:17:15.548 --> 00:17:17.283
Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:17:17.283 --> 00:17:18.651
Love will triumph!

00:17:18.651 --> 00:17:19.985
What's so great about love?!

00:17:19.985 --> 00:17:21.053
Love?

00:17:21.053 --> 00:17:23.489
It's just a siren's song
that tempts the world!

00:17:23.489 --> 00:17:27.560
In the name of reason in
all things, I will drive you away!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.762
But how, Dad?

00:17:29.762 --> 00:17:34.233
Relax, Tenchi. I'm a
member of the Masaki Shrine.

00:17:34.233 --> 00:17:36.869
And shrines have
weapons to defeat demons!

00:17:36.869 --> 00:17:39.105
And that weapon is...

00:17:39.105 --> 00:17:42.942
Welcome to the Tsuchida
Tenman Shrine! How may I help you?

00:17:42.942 --> 00:17:44.710
One exorcising arrow, please.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:45.734
Dad!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.072
Take this!

00:17:52.885 --> 00:17:55.683
Come on, that's not gonna work!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.758
Love!

00:17:58.758 --> 00:18:02.027
<i>Lo... - Ow! Lo... - Ow! Lo... - Ow! Lo... - Ow! Lo... - Ow!</i>

00:18:02.027 --> 00:18:04.325
I... think I've had enough of this.

00:18:09.235 --> 00:18:13.406
A weakling, just as you'd
expect, looking at that exterior.

00:18:13.406 --> 00:18:15.067
Dad...

00:18:22.415 --> 00:18:25.851
What's eating you, Tenchi?

00:18:25.851 --> 00:18:29.388
There's something you want
to tell Kumashiro, isn't there?

00:18:29.388 --> 00:18:32.958
Once I figure out what that is, I'll tell her.

00:18:32.958 --> 00:18:37.930
Tenchi, even if you don't know,
there's a way to do things.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:43.493
Have you told her what you really
want to say? What you should say?

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:51.143
I was clumsy about it, but I told
your mother what needed to be said.

00:18:51.143 --> 00:18:54.013
Mom...

00:18:54.013 --> 00:18:56.682
Go on, boy.

00:18:56.682 --> 00:18:58.115
Right.

00:19:05.591 --> 00:19:07.660
Is it all over now?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.095
Yeah. Thanks.

00:19:10.095 --> 00:19:11.764
Oh.

00:19:11.764 --> 00:19:12.898
Look, l...

00:19:12.898 --> 00:19:14.763
I'll see you later.

00:19:16.802 --> 00:19:18.770
There's... something I need to say.

00:19:24.777 --> 00:19:28.247
I... I still haven't given you an answer yet.

00:19:28.247 --> 00:19:29.715
An answer?

00:19:29.715 --> 00:19:36.021
I don't know if I really love you or not yet.

00:19:36.021 --> 00:19:38.891
So I still can't give you an answer.

00:19:38.891 --> 00:19:42.728
I don't want to give you a rushed answer.

00:19:42.728 --> 00:19:44.997
But I'll give you one.

00:19:44.997 --> 00:19:48.626
I will give you one, so will
you give me that much time?

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.642
I...

00:19:56.642 --> 00:19:58.109
I'm sorry.

00:19:59.044 --> 00:20:02.448
Your nostrils aren't flaring this time.

00:20:02.448 --> 00:20:04.177
Thanks.

00:20:06.519 --> 00:20:08.354
Well, I'll head home now.

00:20:08.354 --> 00:20:10.189
Okay. I'll see you later.

00:20:10.189 --> 00:20:12.783
See you tomorrow, Masaki.

00:20:14.894 --> 00:20:18.386
And thank your father for me, okay?

00:20:29.208 --> 00:20:31.472
Thank you, Dad.

00:20:35.414 --> 00:20:38.817
That the best we can
expect right now, I guess.

00:20:38.817 --> 00:20:41.615
Maybe the time is finally right...

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.792
Food...

00:20:46.792 --> 00:20:48.961
Dinner...

00:20:48.961 --> 00:20:53.432
Bath... I mean, "Kiyone"...

00:20:53.432 --> 00:20:53.699
"Call me for dinner"
Bath... I mean, "Kiyone"...

00:20:53.699 --> 00:20:55.894
"Call me for dinner"

00:20:56.168 --> 00:21:02.708
Cooking and laundry... Cleaning...
Cooking and laundry... Cleaning...

00:21:02.708 --> 00:21:05.268
I've got to...

00:21:36.342 --> 00:21:39.945
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.945 --> 00:21:43.849
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.849 --> 00:21:47.453
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.453 --> 00:21:51.390
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

